# The build context is demo/compose/, and the image takes one file from it:
# the entrypoint. Everything else stays out, so that nothing but that file can
# change what the image is. demo/.env, which holds the keys and the database's
# password, is outside the context altogether.
*
!container-entrypoint.sh
